window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>War is devastating the Kingdom of Vlydyn. Prince Aarian must put his personal desires aside for the good of his kingdom. Abandoning any hope of a life with his childhood love, Aarian agrees to marry an elven princess. The union, while purely political, will bring a lasting peace between humyns and high elves. Not everyone desires peace, however, including a dark elven leader willing to sacrifice his own immortality to stop the marriage. Calling forth a demonic army, the dark elf unleashes a force that threatens the very existence of not just humyns but the world itself.</p>"; 
